Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Comment:
 This package is an unmodified build of upstream release tarballs.
 Full licence texts for GCC are installed next to this file
 (COPYING, COPYING3, COPYING.LIB, COPYING3.LIB, COPYING.RUNTIME).
 .
 The compiler executables (cc1, cc1plus, f951, lto1) statically include
 GMP, MPFR and MPC (GNU LGPL version 3 or later, Free Software
 Foundation, Inc.) and isl (MIT licence, Sven Verdoolaege and others).

Files: *
Copyright: Free Software Foundation, Inc.
License: GPL-3+ with GCC-Runtime-Library-Exception
 GCC is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or
 later. The runtime libraries (libgcc, libstdc++, libgfortran, libgomp,
 libquadmath, libatomic, libitm, sanitizer runtimes and others) carry the
 GCC Runtime Library Exception, version 3.1 (see COPYING.RUNTIME), which
 allows them to be linked into programs under any licence.
 .
 On Debian systems the GPL-3 text is also in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.

